    "name": "Breakout Season",
    "steam_appid": 3682370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.poster.avif?t=1745259713\" width=800 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.webm?t=1745259713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.mp4?t=1745259713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.poster.avif?t=1745259713\" width=800 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.webm?t=1745259713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682370/extras/e752d3da4111df2828c2f7affeb72041.mp4?t=1745259713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike set in a colorful world of juicy blocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim with precision to blast through the block-filled levels, and shoot your way across all four seasons, each bringing new challenges and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending the unpredictable thrill of physics-driven ricochets with strategic planning and clever decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a unique team of blocks, collect powerful, game-changing tools, and turn the chaos in your favor to rack up sky-high points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run brings fresh opportunities to experiment with new builds, wild synergies, and various playstyles.</p>",
    "short_description": "Breakout Season is a chaotic, ball-bouncing roguelike that blends juicy, satisfying destruction with strategic depth and careful planning. Harness the mayhem to your advantage, craft game-breaking synergies, and harvest everything you can before the season ends!",
